          "Both screens attach calendar actions and status transition actions while duplicating UI-state orchestration for pickers and save progress."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Extract shared appointment workflow primitives (time merge/validation, row partitioning, transition handlers) into a domain hook/service, then keep screens focused on role-specific UI differences only.",
