      "detector": "review",
      "file": ".",
      "tier": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "Admin identity enforcement logic is duplicated between a callable and a script with separate mutation paths.",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "design_coherence",
        "related_files": [
          "functions/src/callable/ensureZenithAdmin.ts",
          "functions/src/scripts/enforceSingleAdmin.ts"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "Both files independently resolve the configured admin email, assign admin custom claims, normalize display name, and write role data into `users` docs.",
          "The script additionally demotes other admins, while callable only promotes requester, resulting in two enforcement behaviors for the same policy area.",
          "Policy-critical mutation logic is copied in two entry points instead of sharing one audited core function."
